        <mxCell id="b0b" value="Serially, the story was validated LAST —&lt;br&gt;the riskiest narrative assumption held&lt;br&gt;hostage by the part reviewers already&lt;br&gt;assume works.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Split, each track retires its own risk, and&lt;br&gt;neither can silently break the other." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1a2233;strokeColor=#8b98ab;fontColor=#dbe4f0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="b0">
