        <mxCell id="b0c" value="✓ notebook runs top-to-bottom green on a&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;laptop (Metal)&lt;br&gt;✓ leak test, per owner — zero prompt text&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;to the model owner, zero cross-set text&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;between benchmark owners&lt;br&gt;✓ crucible verify passes on a real scorecard,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;fails on a tampered one" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0a2b1e;strokeColor=#34d399;fontColor=#dbe4f0;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="b0">
